{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43171","headline":"苏着作山池 · 贾彦璋","name":"苏着作山池","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"水树子云家，峯瀛宛不赊。\n芥浮舟是叶，莲发岫爲花。\n酌蚁开春瓮，观鱼凭海查。\n游苏多石友，题赠满瑶华。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾彦璋","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43171.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43171","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}